### Variáveis
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Registrar usuário ADMIN
# @name registrar
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "senha123",
  "nome": "Administrador",
  "email": "admin@agencia.com",
  "perfil": "ADMIN"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### 3. Listar destinos (usa o token da resposta do login acima)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Criar destino (requer ROLE_ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Rio de Janeiro",
  "pais": "Brasil",
  "descricao": "Cidade maravilhosa"
}

### 5. Buscar destino por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 6. Criar hotel vinculado a um destino
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hoteis
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Hotel Copacabana",
  "estrelas": 5,
  "diaria": 450.0,
  "vagasDisponiveis": 20,
  "destino": { "id": 1 }
}

### 7. Listar hotéis de um destino
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hoteis/destino/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 8. Criar pacote de viagem vinculado a um destino
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pacotes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Pacote Rio 5 dias",
  "preco": 1200.0,
  "dataInicio": "2026-10-01",
  "dataFim": "2026-10-05",
  "destino": { "id": 1 }
}

### 9. Listar pacotes de um destino
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pacotes/destino/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
